    "title" : "12 Ormond, Auckland - Niseko Real Estate Photographer",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730785617626\" id=\"item-6729ad6fe679e968889f345a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-eac997ff7089b1a33777\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us:</strong> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">PropertyMedia Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>One Big Spacious Bedroom:</strong> The bedroom is designed to offer comfort and restful privacy, bathed in natural light and featuring thoughtfully selected finishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bright Living Room:</strong> The open living area is ideal for family time or entertaining, filled with natural light from expansive windows that capture the tranquil surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Functional Kitchen:</strong> Equipped with modern appliances and ample storage, the kitchen is both stylish and practical, making meal preparation a joy.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage:</strong> The secure garage provides parking and additional storage, adding convenience to everyday life.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Space for Relaxation:</strong> The property offers a peaceful yard for outdoor dining, gardening, or simply unwinding in the fresh air.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">With its appealing design and convenient location near schools, parks, and shops, 12 Ormond is an excellent opportunity to own a home that combines comfort and charm. This property invites you to enjoy a laid-back lifestyle without sacrificing modern amenities.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;6729ae43f244eb5c4c2b2480&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;6729ae43f244eb5c4c2b2480&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730782483469_79189\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"6729ae432cc31b7b460b0ce7\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730784847649-M62SF78WJYWVEUNCNN9M/12+Ormonde%2C+Auckland++Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%281%29.jpg\" alt=\"12 Ormonde, Auckland  Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Pro